	"Author": "Platonymous",
	"TagLine": "Skips time before you sleep.",
	"Description": "This is most useful if you use mods like Automate which otherwise would stop working after you sleep.\nThe default settings, which can be changed in the config.json (after first launch) or in GMCM, is set to skip 6h.\nIt will not skip past 24:00. Press ESC during the skip to cancel.\n\nIf you like my mods and want to support me, you can do so via [Paypal](https://www.paypal.me/platonymousgames)   or on [Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=406905) .",
